### Health
GET http://localhost:3000/api/health

### Products, filtered
GET http://localhost:3000/api/products?brand=samsung&inStock=true&sort=price_asc

### Search
GET http://localhost:3000/api/products?search=galaxy&limit=5

### Detail
GET http://localhost:3000/api/products/samsung-galaxy-s24-ultra-5g

### EMI options for a given price
GET http://localhost:3000/api/installment-plans?amount=289900

### Log a WhatsApp click
POST http://localhost:3000/api/inquiries
Content-Type: application/json

{ "productId": "prd_s24u", "variantId": "var_s24u_256_blk", "source": "product_page" }

### Submit a callback request
POST http://localhost:3000/api/leads
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Nimal Perera",
  "phone": "077 123 4567",
  "city": "Colombo",
  "productId": "prd_s24u",
  "variantId": "var_s24u_256_blk",
  "message": "Is the black one available?",
  "consent": true
}

### Register
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Nimal Perera", "email": "nimal@example.com",
  "phone": "0771234567", "password": "Test1234", "marketingConsent": true }

### Login
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "nimal@example.com", "password": "Test1234" }

### Me
GET http://localhost:3000/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_ACCESS_TOKEN

### Admin: leads inbox
GET http://localhost:3000/api/admin/leads?status=NEW
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_ADMIN_TOKEN

### Admin: create product
POST http://localhost:3000/api/admin/products
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_ADMIN_TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "OPPO Reno 11",
  "brandId": "brd_oppo",
  "categoryId": "cat_phones",
  "shortDesc": "Portrait camera specialist",
  "condition": "NEW",
  "warrantyType": "1 Year Agent Warranty",
  "variants": [
    { "storage": "256GB", "ram": "8GB", "color": "Wave Green",
      "colorHex": "#2f6f5e", "price": 129900, "salePrice": 119900,
      "stockStatus": "IN_STOCK", "sortOrder": 0 }
  ],
  "images": []
}
